      "content": "\"letting go\" ... that sounds nice, i guess. but it sounds more like just disappearing. like, if i'm not the person i used to be, and there's no point in trying to be someone new... what's the actual point of just dragging this around every day? it just feels like a lot of unnecessary effort.",
